# Names only. These are read ONLY by the offline Node CLI from the operator's host process environment
# (e.g. `OPENAI_API_KEY=... npm run ...` or your shell profile). Never put real values in a committed file.
# Never prefix them with VITE_: anything named VITE_* is bundled into the public viewer.
# Never passed into the sandbox container. Live calls stay refused until Roy approves spend (R1) and the model lock (R2).

# Reviewer A (OpenAI Responses API)
OPENAI_API_KEY=

